MiniCPM-o Agent

This repository is derived from OpenBMB MiniCPM-o / MiniCPM-o 4.5 assets and
code, with modifications focused on a backend/model inference service, package
structure cleanup, tool-call plumbing, and duplex system-prompt cache updates.

Upstream project:
https://github.com/OpenBMB/MiniCPM-o

Model card and model assets:
https://huggingface.co/openbmb/MiniCPM-o-4_5

The upstream MiniCPM-o/V model weights and code are described by OpenBMB as
open-sourced under the Apache-2.0 license. This repository preserves upstream
copyright/license headers where present.
